9	// Agent access tokens are short-lived (~5 min) with no refresh token; the
10	// service-signed identity assertion is the durable credential and is
11	// re-exchanged transparently until it expires. Revocation in the wallet makes
12	// the exchange fail with access_denied — we then stop and require explicit
13	// user action (never auto-re-register).
